                                            <div id="expandReadGuider" class="item">
                                                <h3 class="item-title">拓展阅读</h3>
                                                <div class="recommend-read clearfix">

                                                    <div class="read-img">
                                                        <a href="/article/show_article.do?id=a82896029504" target="_blank" class="article-expand"><img src="https://img.medsci.cn/20240725/1721878424784_92910.png" alt="" /></a>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="read-content">
                                                        <h2><a href="https://www.medsci.cn/article/show_article.do?id=a82896029504" target="_blank" class="ms-link article-expand ms-exposure">Br J Cancer：下消化道癌中黏蛋白特征的临床病理及预后意义</a></h2>
                                                        <p class="text-justify">异常黏蛋白特征反映下消化道良恶性病变的不同分子通路，MUC2高、低表达的生存差异提示其与其他黏蛋白协同参与癌变，肿瘤解剖位置也影响生物学行为。</p>
                                                        <!--<p class="text-justify"><span th:text="${value.author}"></span> · <span>2026-10-27</span></p>-->
                                                    </div>

                                                    
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="recommend-read clearfix">

                                                    <div class="read-img">
                                                        <a href="/article/show_article.do?id=b5cc94608389" target="_blank" class="article-expand"><img src="https://img.medsci.cn/20240801/1722478074459_92910.png" alt="" /></a>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="read-content">
                                                        <h2><a href="https://www.medsci.cn/article/show_article.do?id=b5cc94608389" target="_blank" class="ms-link article-expand ms-exposure">Journal of Global Health：五岁以下儿童RSV相关急性中耳炎</a></h2>
                                                        <p class="text-justify">这项研究发现超过四分之一的RSV感染会并发急性中耳炎，同时在急性中耳炎患儿样本中RSV检出率也较高，且绝大多数RSV阳性中耳液样本同时存在细菌感染。</p>
                                                        <!--<p class="text-justify"><span th:text="${value.author}"></span> · <span>2026-08-09</span></p>-->
                                                    </div>

                                                    
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="recommend-read clearfix">

                                                    <div class="read-img">
                                                        <a href="/article/show_article.do?id=b0d494424e7b" target="_blank" class="article-expand"><img src="https://img.medsci.cn/20260416/1776308021141_8538692.jpg" alt="" /></a>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="read-content">
                                                        <h2><a href="https://www.medsci.cn/article/show_article.do?id=b0d494424e7b" target="_blank" class="ms-link article-expand ms-exposure">主编推荐 ‖ 2000—2025年中国健康人群血清破伤风IgG抗体阳性率和保护率的Meta分析</a></h2>
                                                        <p class="text-justify">中国健康人群破伤风免疫保护存在明显不足，青少年及成人免疫缺口巨大，亟需加强免疫策略优化。</p>
                                                        <!--<p class="text-justify"><span th:text="${value.author}"></span> · <span>2026-07-24</span></p>-->
                                                    </div>

                                                    
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="recommend-read clearfix">

                                                    <div class="read-img">
                                                        <a href="/article/show_article.do?id=a980939282c9" target="_blank" class="article-expand"><img src="https://img.medsci.cn/20250925/1758794006525_8538692.png" alt="" /></a>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="read-content">
                                                        <h2><a href="https://www.medsci.cn/article/show_article.do?id=a980939282c9" target="_blank" class="ms-link article-expand ms-exposure">ESMO Open：新辅助免疫检查点抑制剂治疗局部dMMR/MSI-H胃癌的荟萃分析</a></h2>
                                                        <p class="text-justify">新辅助免疫检查点抑制剂在局部dMMR/MSI-H胃癌及胃食管交界处癌患者中具有较高的病理和临床缓解率，且严重免疫相关不良事件发生率较低，延长治疗时长至三个月以上有助于提高病理完全缓解率。</p>
                                                        <!--<p class="text-justify"><span th:text="${value.author}"></span> · <span>2026-06-06</span></p>-->
                                                    </div>

                                                    
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="recommend-read clearfix">

                                                    <div class="read-img">
                                                        <a href="/article/show_article.do?id=76b893906181" target="_blank" class="article-expand"><img src="https://img.medsci.cn/20251105/1762321916670_8538692.png" alt="" /></a>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="read-content">
                                                        <h2><a href="https://www.medsci.cn/article/show_article.do?id=76b893906181" target="_blank" class="ms-link article-expand ms-exposure">Nursing in Critical Care：别再指责护士了！ICU 里被遗漏的护理，根源在系统而非个人</a></h2>
                                                        <p class="text-justify">本研究结论明确将ICU护理缺失重新定义为一种可预测的系统驱动过程，而非个人失职。</p>
                                                        <!--<p class="text-justify"><span th:text="${value.author}"></span> · <span>2026-06-01</span></p>-->
                                                    </div>

                                                    
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="recommend-read clearfix">

                                                    <div class="read-img">
                                                        <a href="/article/show_article.do?id=e0c0925430eb" target="_blank" class="article-expand"><img src="https://img.medsci.cn/20250220/1740013465025_8538692.png" alt="" /></a>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="read-content">
                                                        <h2><a href="https://www.medsci.cn/article/show_article.do?id=e0c0925430eb" target="_blank" class="ms-link article-expand ms-exposure">超 7000 名孕妈数据揭示：助产士主导护理，缓解焦虑恐惧还能减少剖宫产</a></h2>
                                                        <p class="text-justify">本Meta分析表明与标准孕产护理相比，助产士主导的护理模式（包括心理教育、咨询、正念护理以及连续性或团体护理）能显著改善孕产妇的心理健康，并带来积极的产科结局。</p>
                                                        <!--<p class="text-justify"><span th:text="${value.author}"></span> · <span>2026-02-09</span></p>-->
                                                    </div>

                                                    
                                                </div>
